  "responsibility": "Settles cards, frames, routes and labels as one drawing, with the engine the render names: Track or Blocks",
  "description": "Nothing after it may repair a coordinate. Track, the default, lays the board out with its containers and group regions drawn inline; Blocks packs each as a block of its own. Both rank cards with Graphviz and route on tracks, Blocks routes the trunks between its blocks with libavoid, and each keeps the way of laying the board out that reads best. Crossings are bridged here. Every variant is laid out fresh (ADR 0032, ADR 0040).",
